sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant Database

    User->>Frontend: Fill Student Form & Submit
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/students
    Backend->>Backend: Validate payload
    Backend->>Database: Save student record
    Database-->>Backend: Saved student entity
    Backend-->>Frontend: 201 Created (StudentResponse)
    Frontend-->>User: Show success toast notification
